<%- include('partials/header') %>
<article class="narrow card prose">
  <h1>Community rules</h1>
  <p>The <%= site.productName %> Community is where people who install, run and build on <%= site.productName %> help each other. Keep it useful and friendly.</p>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Be respectful.</strong> No harassment, personal attacks or discrimination.</li>
    <li><strong>One problem per thread.</strong> Use a clear title and include your version, setup and what you have tried.</li>
    <li><strong>Protect your system.</strong> Never post passwords, API keys, full public IP addresses or customer phone numbers.</li>
    <li><strong>No spam or advertising.</strong> Relevant links are welcome. Promotional posts will be removed.</li>
    <li><strong>Report security vulnerabilities privately</strong> through the contact page, not in a public thread.</li>
    <li><strong>Mark the answer that solved it</strong> so the next person finds it quickly.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>Who answers</h2>
  <p>The <%= supportTeamName %> team reads every thread. Their replies carry the <span class="badge badge--staff"><%= supportTeamName %></span> badge. Members are welcome to help each other too.</p>
</article>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
